---
config:
  layout: elk
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
    fontSize: "15px"
    primaryTextColor: "#203040"
    lineColor: "#475569"
    edgeLabelBackground: "#ffffff"
  flowchart:
    htmlLabels: false
    nodeSpacing: 25
    rankSpacing: 45
  elk:
    nodePlacementStrategy: BRANDES_KOEPF
    mergeEdges: false
---
flowchart TB
    R[Accepted ledger root<br/>at chainpoint P]:::anchor -->|Verify against| T[Terminal checks]:::terminal
    subgraph U[Untrusted services]
      A[Provider A]:::ledger
      B[Provider B]:::ledger
      P[Application<br/>builder]:::app
    end
    A -->|UTxO + witness| T
    B -->|Equivalent claim| T
    P -->|Application proofs| T
    T -->|All links verify| V[Verified application<br/>claim]:::terminal
    T -->|Evidence fails| E[Explicit rejection]:::neutral
    V -->|Transaction policy| X[Construct transaction]:::terminal
    V -->|Effect policy| S{Settlement condition<br/>satisfied?}:::terminal
    S -->|Yes + authorization| F[Authorize effect]:::terminal
    S -->|No or abandoned point| E
    style U fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#687384,stroke-dasharray:5 4
    classDef anchor fill:#e1f3eb,stroke:#2c7155,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#163d2e
    classDef ledger fill:#e6effc,stroke:#416dad,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#203a63
    classDef app fill:#fff0dd,stroke:#a46b25,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#644317
    classDef terminal fill:#eee8fa,stroke:#7856a8,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#463064
    classDef neutral fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#687384,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#293342
